tart=\"4384\" data-end=\"4397\">Bombinhas</strong>, and finish the circuit in the luxurious and lively <strong data-start=\"4450\" data-end=\"4472\">Balne&aacute;rio Cambori&uacute;</strong>, known as the &ldquo;Monaco of the Atlantic&rdquo;.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4514\" data-end=\"4589\"><strong data-start=\"4514\" data-end=\"4537\">Book your seat now!</strong><br data-start=\"4537\" data-end=\"4540\">Only 2 exclusive departures by <strong data-start=\"4571\" data-end=\"4588\">Metele Brasil</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4591\" data-end=\"4627\">SCHEDULED DEPARTURES &ndash; JANUARY</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4628\" data-end=\"4723\">???? <strong data-start=\"4631\" data-end=\"4645\">Departure:</strong> Saturday, January 18<br data-start=\"4666\" data-end=\"4669\">????´©Å <strong data-start=\"4673\" data-end=\"4685\">Arrival:</strong> Sunday, January 19 (in the afternoon)</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4725\" data-end=\"4746\">GENERAL DETAILS</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4747\" data-end=\"4891\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4747\" data-end=\"4764\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4749\" data-end=\"4764\">Full circuit.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4765\" data-end=\"4799\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4767\" data-end=\"4799\">SEMI CAMA Bus | Comfort Plus units.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4893\" data-end=\"4933\">BOARDING POINTS &ndash; SALTA AND REGION</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4934\" data-end=\"5325\">???? <strong data-start=\"4937\" data-end=\"4951\">SALTA CITY</strong> | Bus Terminal &ndash; Platform 4 | 6:00 p.m.<br data-start=\"4991\" data-end=\"4994\">???? <strong data-start=\"4997\" data-end=\"5006\">MET&Aacute;N</strong> | YPF Service Station &ndash; Route 9/34 | 7:15 p.m.<br data-start=\"5053\" data-end=\"5056\">???? <strong data-start=\"5059\" data-end=\"5085\">ROSARIO DE LA FRONTERA</strong> | YPF Station &ndash; Route 9 | 8:00 p.m.<br data-start=\"5121\" data-end=\"5124\">???? <strong data-start=\"5127\" data-end=\"5138\">TUCUM&Aacute;N</strong> | Bus Terminal &ndash; Platform 