ute;rio Cambori&uacute;.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"1079\"><strong data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"922\">BOARDING POINTS &ndash; FIRMAT, ROSARIO, AND SANTA FE</strong><br data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"925\">???? FIRMAT | YPF Stop &ndash; Route 33 | 6:00 PM<br data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"969\">???? ROSARIO | Bus Terminal &ndash; Platform 1 | 6:45 PM<br data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1020\">???? SANTA FE CAPITAL | Bus Terminal &ndash; Platform 5 | 7:30 PM</p>','<p data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1180\"><strong data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1178\">CIRCUITO SUL DO BRASIL &ndash; FLORIAN&Oacute;POLIS | BOMBINHAS | BALNE&Aacute;RIO CAMBORI&Uacute;</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1494\">Sa&iacute;mos de &ocirc;nibus de Firmat, passando por Rosario e Santa F&eacute;, em dire&ccedil;&atilde;o ao Sul do Brasil. Nosso primeiro desembarque ser&aacute; na famosa ilha de Florian&oacute;polis. Em seguida, continuamos para a charmosa Bombinhas e finalizamos o percurso no luxuoso e animado Balne&aacute;rio Cambori&uacute;, conhecido como o &ldquo;M&ocirc;naco do Atl&acirc;ntico&rdquo;.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1566\">Garanta j&aacute; seu lugar!<br data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1520\">Apenas 2 sa&iacute;das exclusivas da Metele Brasil.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1684\"><strong data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1600\">SA&Iacute;DAS PROGRAMADAS &ndash; JANEIRO</strong><br data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1603\">???? Sa&iacute;da: S&aacute;bado, 18 de Janeiro<br data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1637\">????´©Å Chegada: Domingo, 19 de Janeiro (&agrave; tarde)</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1707\"><strong data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1705\">DETALHES GERAIS</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1888\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1740\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1740\">Circuito completo de &ocirc;nibus.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1782\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1782\">&Ocirc;nibus leito | Unidades Confort Plus.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1888\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1888\">Transporte ida e volta: Firmat &rarr; Rosario &rarr; Santa F&eacute; &rarr; Florian&oacute;polis &rarr; Bombinhas &rarr; Balne&aacute;rio Cambori&uacute;.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"2110\"><strong data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1941\">PONTOS DE EMBARQUE &ndash; FIRMAT, ROSARIO E SANTA F&Eacute;</strong><br data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"1944\">???? FIRMAT | Parador YPF &ndash; Rota 33 | 18:00<br data-start=\"1985\" data-end=\"1988\">???? ROSARIO | Terminal de &Ocirc;nibus &ndash; Plataforma 1 | 18:45<br data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2045\">???? SANTA F&Eacute; CAPITAL | Terminal de &Ocirc;nibus &ndash; Plataforma 5 | 19:30</p>','<p data-start=\"74\" data-end=\"153\"><strong data-start=\"74\" data-end=\"151\">CIRCUITO SUD DEL BRASILE &ndash; FLORIAN&Oacute;POLIS | BOMBINHAS | BALNE&Aacute;RIO CAMBORI&Uacute;</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"155\" data-end=\"489\">Partiamo in autobus da Firmat, passando per Rosario e Santa Fe, verso il Sud del Brasile. La nostra prima fermata sar&agrave; sulla famosa isola di Florian&oacute;polis. Successivamente, continueremo verso la affascinante Bombinhas e concluderemo il percorso nella lussuosa e vivace Balne&aacute;rio Cambori&uacute;, conosciuta come il &ldquo;Monaco dell&rsquo;Atlantico&rdquo;.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"570\">Assicurati subito il tuo posto!<br data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"525\">Solo 2 partenze esclusive di Metele Brasil.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"688\"><strong data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"606\">PARTENZE PROGRAMMATE &ndash; GENNAIO</strong><br data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"609\">???? Partenza: Sabato 18 Gennaio<br data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"642\">????´©Å Arrivo: Domenica 19 Gennaio (pomeriggio)</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"713\"><strong data-start=\"690\" dat